# Python / FastAPI

- Python 3.12+ (local may use 3.13 if 3.12 unavailable). Independent `.venv` per service.
- Never install AI deps globally. Use `requirements.txt` or `pyproject.toml` per service.
- Structure: `app/api`, `app/application`, `app/domain`, `app/infrastructure`.
- Uvicorn for local; separate Lambda handler module for future AWS.
- pytest for tests; OpenAPI 3.1 contracts aligned with FastAPI routes.
- Mock providers by default for Model Gateway / vision / embeddings.
- Do not log raw camera feeds, API keys, or PII photographs.
- Ports: platform services 8101–8109; Python business services as assigned.
